<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Projet Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="toc3">Fdp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Fidiphu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda kwena bisi Fidiphu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda kwena bisi Fidiphu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Fidiphu</para>
  <para style="imt1">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Pholu kákangula Dibundu dya Fidiphu muna tangwa dya kitambu kyandi kina kya zodi kya kitumu. Dyadina Dibundu dya theti kákangula ku tsi ya Elopha. Mbanza ya Fidiphu yenina kuna kimama kya londi dya Ngeleti, muna kinzunga kya Masetwani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda wa Pholu kwena bakidisitu ba Fidiphu wubati songila bikhunda bya ngolu bina byenina ha kati dya thumwa yi kimvuka kya bakidisitu. Pholu wuzodini ni kakwatikisabya hika ngolu. Mu boloku kenina. Phasi kabati mona kikuma kya buna kalendaku mu kuhanga kima keti kubatala bisi Fidiphu. Kabati bazimbwala mutindu wa lungongu luna kenina wawu kikuma kya bawu. Kabati zimbula phi ni mu kiwayi kenina. Kikuma, batu bahika babati basamwana Kidisitu mu sunga dya mbi amana bazodi ni babanatina mu lengu ndinga (1:15-17; 2:21; 3:2 yi 18). Pholu wusini kivuvu mu kutuma basindikidi bandi ba kisalu ku Fidiphu mu kwenda hana kikesa kwena kimvuka kya bakidisitu yi kubonga tsangu za bawu (2:19-30). Kwena bawu, bakidisitu ba ku Fidiphu hanga bamuhitikini Pholu makabu (4:10-20). Mukanda kwena bisi Fidiphu wubati vutula matondu kwena bisi Fidiphu, wubati baheka malongi yi kikesa muna lukwikilu lwa bawu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pholu kabati sya kuna mesu ma bisi Fidiphu luzingu yi lufwa lwa Pfumu Yesu (2:6-11). Yesu wásisa byosu bina kákala byawu. Kikuma kya bwabuna, Nzambi wámutombula ha thandu ya kima kyosu yi boosu. Phila mosi phi yi Pholu wásisa miluta mina bakala muheka theti ku dingumba dina dya Bayuta (3:3-10). Buthwena, wutambwasini mu kunyokuka kikuma kya Yesu Kidisitu. Mu boloku kenina, amana wayilama kenina mu kulambula luzingu lwandi. Kenina yi kivuvu kya kufutumuka, kilumbu kimosi, ku lufwa. Thumwa kabati lomba kwena bisi Fidiphu mu kulanda mbandu ya yandi (3:17; 4:9.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu kuleya kwa mukanda wawu wosu, Pholu kabati zimbula kyesi kina kisi muheka lukwikilu. Kabati hana kikesa kwena bisi Fidiphu mu kuzingilaka mu kyesi. Kyesi meni kina kyisi monikina muna lebakani yi muna phasi, muna tangwa dina benina bakidisitu mu kithwadi bawu yi bawu ha kimosi yi Pfumu Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Meni Pholu yi Thimoti, basadi ba Kidisitu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Kwena bakwikidi boosu benina mwena Kidisitu Yesu kuna Fidiphu, yi batwadisi yi kwena basyelu: <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Yambula Nzambi Tata wetu yi Pfumu Yesu Kidisitu baluheka khenda yi ngemba.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Matondu yi lombilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Yisi vutula matondu kwena Nzambi wama muna mbala zoosu zina yisi lusungula. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Yisiku lembwa mu kulombilaka yi kyesi muna bilomba byama byosu kikuma kya benu boosu, <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>kikuma kya lusadisu lwenu ku Musamu wa Bukheti, tuka kilumbu kya theti yi buthwena bwabu. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Yenina yi kikumbwala ni wuna wáyandika muhangu wa bukheti ha kati dya benu, kalánda tsuka ya wawu yi muna kilumbu kya kwisa kwa Kidisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Bwenina bwa masonga kikuma kya meni ni yikala yi mabanza ma mutindu wawu kwena benu boosu. Kikuma, lwenina muna mbundu yama, benu boosu lwisi khundakana muna kabu dina kaphekini Nzambi, dyakala mu tangwa dina yenina mu miyololu, keti mu tangwa dina yisi zonzila Musamu wa Bukheti ni wa kyedika wenina. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Kikuma, Nzambi kenina mbangi wama: yenina yi tsambu ya lawu kikuma kya benu boosu, muna lungongu lwa Kidisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Amana tala mana yisi lomba kwena Nzambi muna bisambu byama: zola dyenu dyavulaka kosu tangwa, dyákala dyabasa muna mazaya yi muna mbakisilu yalunga, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>bwabuna lwazáyila kubangumuna mambu ma mboti. Ndangu lwakala batu ba kasemi amana bakonda kifu muna kilumbu kya Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Lwakála babasa mu mihangu mya masonga mana misi tuka mu nzila ya Yesu Kidisitu, kikuma kya khembu yi lukumu lwa Nzambi.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzingu, Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Nzodi ni lwazayabwa, baphangi: mambu mana mambwidiki matomi sadisa mu kumwangana kwa Musamu wa Bukheti. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Muna mutindu meni wawuna, batsinzidi boosu muna nganda ya pfumu wa mbanza yi muma mwosu, bazaya ni mu miyololu yenina kikuma kya Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Amana miyololu myama mihani kikesa kwena baphangi ba lawu mwena Pfumu, mu kukasa kwa mbundu kikuma kya kulonga Ndinga ya Nzambi konda bweya.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Bwa kyedika ni bahika hana kati dya bawu babati samuna musamu wa Kidisitu mu kiphala yi mabanza ma ngyuma, kaasi bakwawu bisiwa samuna yi mabanza ma bukheti. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Baba baba babatibwa sadila mu lungongu mukuma bazayi ni yenina hana kikuma kya kuzonzila Musamu wa Bukheti. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Bahika babati samuna musamu wa Kidisitu yi mabanza ma kunwanina; mabanza ma bawu ma mbi menina, bisi banza ni bakosikila hika kiwayi hana thandu ya miyololu myama.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Ka dyambu ku! Kima kihitini mupfunu mu byosu, keti bweti babati samuna musamu yi mesu ku tsi ya lukaya kondilo ma kyedika, musamu wa Kidisitu babatiwa samuna, amana nsangwadini kikuma kya bwabuna. Yilánda hika mu kusangwala, <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>mukuma nzayi ni mamana moosu mabáluka kikuma kya luhulusu lwama, kikuma kya bisambu byenu yi mu lusadisu luna kisi ndatina Kitembu wa Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Kikuma, muna mana mbati hingila, mana tsidini kivuvu, yikwátukaku tsoni. Kaasi, keti buthwena, keti bilumbu byosu, yi kikumbwala kya lawu yisóngila kutoka kwa Kidisitu muna lutu lwama lwosu, keti mu luzingu lwama, kondilo muna lufwa lwama. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Mukuma, kikuma kya meni, luzingu lwenina Kidisitu amana lufwa lwenina lufutu. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Kaasi yuka ni kukala mu luzingu lwa kimutu kwapheka hika muswa wa kulungisa muhangu wa mupfunu, hana nzayiku keti biki fwani yisola hika. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Mbati nwana yi mambu modi mama mabati tendana: nzodi yikatuka mu luzingu lwalu lwa kimutu ndangu yikala yi Kidisitu, bwabuna buhiti kitoku; <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>kaasi kikuma kya benu, bulungi yinanga hika mu luzingu lwa kimutu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Amana bwosu tsini mbundu muna bwabuna, nzayi ni mu luzingu yikála hika, yinánga hika hakimosi yi benu boosu kikuma kya kulusadisaka ndangu lwakola amana lwakala mu kyesi muna lukwikilu. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Ndangu, tangwa yikála hika ha kati dya benu, kyesi kyenu mwena Kidisitu Yesu kyalútuka kuhita kina lwáyuka mu kumbona hika meni.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Kima kimosi, lwazingila bwosu buna wulombini Musamu wa Bukheti wa Kidisitu. Ndangu, ata yisi lutala, ata yisiku lutala, yiyukaka ni ludisimbididi mu kithwadi muna kitembu kimosi, lubati nwana hakimosi muna mbundu yimosi kikuma kya lukwikilu luna lwátungila ha thandu ya Musamu wa Bukheti. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Amana lubayukaku bweya babana bisi lutendisa; kina kyakála kidimbu kikuma kya kuzangana kwa bawu, amana benu mu nzila ya luhulusu lwenina; kwena Nzambi misi tuka mamana. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Mukuma, muna mana matadidini Kidisitu, Nzambi káluhekila khenda, heku ni kikuma kya kukwikila lwesi mwena yandi, kaasi kikuma phi kya kunyokuka kikuma kya yandi. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Buthwena, lubati nwana mvita ya mutindu wumosi yi yina lwámbona meni mu kunwana mbala yikwawu, amana yi yayina bwosu luzayini, mbati nwana hika.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kudikulumuna yi kutoka kwa Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Kikhunda kyenu hakimosi yi Kidisitu, kikesa kyisi luheka? Lungongu lwandi lwisi lusangumuna? Mu kithwadi lwenina yi Kitembu? Lwenina yi zola yi buweti hana kati dya benu yi benu? <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Basisenu kyesi kyama mu nzila ya kuyukanaka, kukalaka yi zola dimosi, kukhundakanaka mu mbundu yi mabanza. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Luhangaku kima mu mbundu ya kuwila, kondilo mu kusanda lukumu lwa phamba-phamba kaasi mu kudikulumunaka, lwamonaka bakwenu hanga mbedi ni baluhitini benu. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Ka mutu ku kasandaka lwesi muluta wa yandi meni, kaasi kosu mutu kabanzilaka phi bakwawu. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Hana kati dya benu, banzakenu hanga batu benina bakhundakana kwena Kidisitu Yesu:<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Yandi wákala Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">kaasi kámonabwoku hanga kima kya kuwila.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Kaasi wádiwongumuna mu byosu bina kákala byawu, amana wádikitula hanga musadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Wákituka mutu hana kati dya batu; kázayakana hanga mutu;<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>wátoma dikulumuna amana wádisongila mutu wa bulemvu yi kuna lufwa, lufwa hana kitakani.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Yi hakana phi, Nzambi wámutombula hana kisoka amana wámuheka zina dina dihitini zina dyosu.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Ndangu, muna zina dya Yesu, kungulu dyosu dyafukama, muna mazilu yi hana tsi yi muna sina dya tsi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sina dya tsi: mihowu myami mizonzi phi ni muna kalunga. </char></note>,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>amana munwa wosu wasamuna, muna khembu ya Nzambi Tata: «Yesu Kidisitu kenina Pfumu!»<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulema hanga mwini muna tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Yi hana ni, baphangi batondama, bwosu buna lwakala lemvuka tangwa dyosu dina yíkala kwena benu, hangenu hika mutindu wumosi buthwena bwabu yeninahoku. Landenu bwabuna mu kusadila luhulusu lwenu, yi luzitu yi kitswi, <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>mukuma Nzambi kabati sala hana kati dya benu, kabati lukitula batu bana balungini mu luzolu yi kulungisa mana mafwanakani yi tsambu ya yandi ya bukheti.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Salenu dyambu dyosu konda kunyengalakana keti matendu, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>ndangu lwakala konda kifu amana ba kasemi, bana ba Nzambi bakonda kifu hana kati dya batu babana ba mbi yi bazangana ba tsi yayi. Lufweti kenzula hanga mwini wa tsi, <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>mu kunataka ndinga ya luzingu. Lwaluna lwakála lulendu lwama muna kilumbu kya Kidisitu: kikuma yítakulaku mu phamba, kondilo yínyokukaku mu phamba.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Kaasi keti bweti ni menga mama mafwani kutyakana, hanga kabu dina bakosikidi ku kimenga kikuma kya kisalu kya lukwikilu lwenu; muna bwabuna, mu kyesi yenina amana mbati sangwala hakimosi yi benu boosu. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Sangwalenu benu phi, amana sangwalenu hakimosi yi meni.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitumu kya Thimoti yi Ephafoditi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Tsini kivuvu, mwena Pfumu Yesu, mu kuluhitika, ka thama ku, Thimoti, ndangu yibongila kikesa muna mameni ma benu mana kambénikina. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Kikuma, heku mutu wa hika walenda bakisa mabanza mama kikuma kya benu, yuka ni ka yandi ku lwesi yi mu kudiyangisaka, kyedika, kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Boosu babana basadini, ndandu za bawu meni lwesi bisi sanda kaasi bisiku sanda mambu ma Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Kaasi kikuma kya Thimoti, luzayini benu benu mutindu wuna kádihanina kwena meni mu kusala kisalu kya Musamu wa Bukheti, hanga mwana bela-bela yi tata wandi. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Amana khwikidi ni yilúhitika yandi tangwa dina yibákisila mutindu wuna mabati kwendila mambu meni meni; <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>amana yenina yi kikumbwala, mwena Pfumu, ni ka thama ku, yikwisa lutala meni meni.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Amana, mboni ni bwenina bukheti mu kuluhitika phangi wama Ephafoditi, wenina phi mukwetu wama wa kisalu yi musadi wuna wisi tsadisa mu kunwana muzingu, wuna wenina phi muzika wuna lwátuma benu mu kundatina bima bina yikadi byawu mupfunu. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Kikuma kenina yi tsambu mu kulumona hika benu boosu, amana phasi lawu kayukiki ku mbundu kikuma benu lwayuki ni yandi wabela kakadikini. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Kikuma, wabela kákala amana kakala lakana; kaasi Nzambi kyadi kámuyukila amana ka kikuma kya yandi lwesi ku, kaasi ndangu phi khalaku mu kyadi kya lawu. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Yimutumi hika yi tswasu yosu, ndangu lwasangwala mu kumumona, amana meni meni yikala yi kyadi kya khunda. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Yihakana ni, muyambenu yi kyesi kyosu mwena Pfumu. Bazitisakenu batu ba mutindu wuna, <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>mukuma, kazodi kafwa kikuma kya kisalu kya Kidisitu; bwosu lwaléndaku benu mu kwisa tsadisa, yandi wátambwasa mu kusya luzingu lwandi mu kihonza ndangu kisa tsadisa.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Mutu walunga ku mesu ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Mu kumanisa, baphangi bama, sangwalenu mu kukala mwena Pfumu. Bungyeku phasi mu kululandwadila mana yílusonikina kedi, mamana málusadisa mu kulutanina. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Kebenu yi bambwa<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna tangwa dina, mbwa bakala mumona hanga mbisi mosi walewuka. Muhowu wawu wubati zonzila batu bana bakala tsikisa mukhanda. Tala hika muna Mth 7:6. </char></note> babana, kebenu yi basadi ba mbi, kebenu yi batu bana bisi lulundika mu kudikotisa mukhanda! <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Mukuma betu thwenina batu babana bákota mukhanda wa mukwandi, betu babana thwisi sadila Nzambi mu nzila ya Kitembu kyandi, thwisi ditsikisila mwena Kidisitu Yesu, amana thwisiku sya kikumbwala mu mambu ma lutu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Kinga, meni phi, yenina mawu mambu mana pfwani yisila kikumbwala muna lutu. Ho ni mutu kabanzaka ni fwani kasya kivuvu mu mambu ma lutu, meni ndungi mu kuhangabwa kuluta. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Mu kilumbu kya nana, kunima lubutuku lwama, yíkota mukhanda, yenina mukwa Kiseledi wa mukwandi, muna kanda dya Benzyame, mwisi Hebelu yenina, muna butuka dya Hebelu. Muna mana matadidi mitsiku, Mufwadisi khadikini, <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>muna mana matadidini zangi, yínyokuna Dibundu. Muna mana matadidini masonga mana bisi sanda batu mu nzila ya mitsiku, yíkala konda kifu. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Kaasi mambu mana mákhala hanga ndandu, mbatima mona buthwena hanga kima kya phamba kikuma kya Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Kaasi mbati tala mambu mana moosu hanga kima kya phamba, kikuma kya mamboti mama mahitini mu kutoka: kuzaya Kidisitu Yesu Pfumu wama, kikuma kya yandi yítambwasila mu kutotisa mambu mana moosu, amana yisi mona moosu hanga tswala, ndangu yibonga Kidisitu <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>amana bisa ngwana mwena yandi. Bangwanaku yi masonga ma meni-meni mana misi tuka ku mitsiku, kaasi mana misi tuka mu nzila ya lukwikilu mwena Kidisitu, masonga mamosi misi tuka kwena Nzambi amana misi yekamina mu lukwikilu. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Kima nzodini, kumuzaya Kidisitu yi ngolu za lufutumuku lwandi, kukala mu kithwadi ku phasi zandi yi kufwanana yi yandi muna lufwa lwandi, <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>yi kivuvu ni meni phi yifútumuka ha kati dya bafwa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thinu ku kinunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Heku ni mbongima kedi mambu mana moosu, holo ni moosu mandungidi kedi; kaasi thinu mbati kwenda ndangu yibongama, kikuma Kidisitu Yesu wákhwata kedi. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Muna mambu mana mathadidini, baphangi, khwikidiku ni mbongilwa kedi lufutu meni luna; kaasi tsumbi yama yimosi: kuzimbakana mambu moosu mana menina ku manima mama amana yisya ngolu mu mambu mana menina ku thwala. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Muna bwabuna, thinu mbati kwenda yi kuna yitudila ku tsuka, ndangu yibonga lufutu luna káthedila Nzambi tuka ku zilu, mwena Kidisitu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Disongidila, betu boosu babana twenina bakidisitu bakola, tubanzakenu bwabuna. Amana yuka ni mu dyambu dimosi bwabu, lubati banza mutindu wahika, Nzambi kalúsongilabwa wengele. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Muna moosu mamana, hana tutudi kedi buthwena, tulandenu mu kukangalaka nzila mosi.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Baphangi, landenu mbandu ya meni, amana simbululenu mboti batu babana bisi dyatila mu mutindu wa luzingu luna lwamonini kwena betu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Mukuma, bwosu buna yisi luzimbwala kosu tangwa yi buthwena bwabu, mbati luzimbwala hika yi matsanga muna mesu, ni lawu benina babana benina bambeni ba kitakani kya Kidisitu kikuma kya ndyatidi ya bawu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Tsuka ya bawu yenina kuzangana, nzambi wa bawu kenina kundu dya bawu; amana khembu ya bawu yenina muna mambu mana misi bakwatisa tsoni amana bisi sya mabanza ma bawu muna bima bya tsi. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Kaasi kwena betu, thwenina bisi mbanza ya mazilu. Amana tukidila kwakuna, tubati hingila hanga muhuludi, Pfumu Yesu Kidisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Yandi wuna wakwisa balumuna lutu lwetu luna lwisi fwa ndangu lwakituka hanga lutu lwandi lwa khembu, muna nzila ya ngolu zina zisi muheka hamu dya kusya bima byosu muna sina dya luyalu lwandi.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Yi hakana ni, baphangi bama batondama, benu babana yisi yukila tsambu ya lawu mu kulumona, benu lwenina kyesi kyama yi mukhonzi wama, kalenu bakwikama muna luzingu lwenu yi Pfumu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Milongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Yibahekini kikesa Evwodi yi Setiki ni bayukanaka bawu yi bawu mwena Pfumu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Kwena ngeyi phi mukwetu wa kyedika wa kisalu, yikulombini ni wabasadisa, mukuma banwaniki lawu kikuma kya Musamu wa Bukheti, mu kithwadi yi meni; phila mosi phi yi Kelemasi yi bakwetu bahika ba kisalu, babana básonama mazina ma bawu muna mukanda wa moya. <verse eid="PHP 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Sangwalakenu kosu tangwa mu kithwadi yi Pfumu; ndanduludibwa hika ni sangwalakenu. <verse eid="PHP 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Yambulenu buweti bwenu bwazayakana kwena batu boosu. Pfumu wekina bela-bela. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Ludiyangisaku kikuma kya kima kimosi, kaasi muna mambu moosu, hanakenu bilomba byenu kwena Nzambi muna nzila ya kubokwadila hakimosi yi makabu ma kuvutula kwa matondu. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Amana ngemba ya Nzambi yina yihitini mabanza moosu yalúnda mbundu zenu yi mabanza menu mwena Kidisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Mu kumanisa baphangi bama, mambu moosu mana menina ma kyedika, moosu mana menina ma kitoku, moosu mana menina ma masonga, moosu mana menina ma kasemi, moosu mana misi sephidisa batu, yuka ni ndyambu dimosi dya bukheti dyenina hana, yindulakenu kikuma kya mawu. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Mambu moosu mana lwálonguka, lwátambula yi mana lwáyuka kwena meni kondilo mana lwámona kwena meni, sadilenu mamana. Amana Nzambi wa ngemba kakála yi benu.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pholu vutudini matondu kwena bisi Fidiphu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Tsangwadi lawu mwena Pfumu, kikuma tsuka-tsuka, lungyubuki hika. Bwa kyedika ni lumbanziki kedi, kaasi lukadikiku yi phila ya kusongilabwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Nzonzidibwoku ni kikuma kya kukonda kima, kikuma yílonguka kedi mu kukalaka mu kyesi muna mutindu wuna yenina. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Nzayini mu kuzingila mu kiphutu bwosu buna pfwani phi yizingila mu bima bya lawu. Yílonguka mu kukala sangu-sangu kosu tangwa yi muma mwosu, keti ngyukutini, ho loni yenina yi nzala, keti yenina yi bima byafwana, ho loni khondi kima. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Pfwani yisala mambu moosu muna nzila ya yandi wuna wisi pheka ngolu. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Kaasi bwa buketi luhangini mu kungwaphama mu mambu matadidini biwayi byama. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Luzayibwa kwenu bukheti, benu-benu bisi Fidiphu: tangwa yíkatuka ku Masetwani, muna tangwa dina yíyandika kuyadingisa kwa Musamu wa Bukheti, benu lwákala Dibundu dimosi mu kutsadisa, benu lwesi lwákota mambu matadidini phasi zama keti mu kyesi kyama. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Mukuma, ha yíkala ku Tesalonika, benu phi lwáphitika hika mu mbala ya zodi bina yíkala byawu mupfunu. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Heku ni makabu mbati sanda; kima mbati sanda, lufutu lwa mihangu myenu mya bukheti lwayikama hika kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Yenina yi bima byosu amana yenina byawu hika lawu, mbongibya byosu bina luphitikiki muna moku ma Ephafoditi. Mana menina mananasi ma mvumba ya kitoku, kimenga kina katambwasini Nzambi, kina kyisi musephidisa yandi. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Nzambi wama kabásisa byosu bina luvwini mupfunu, bwosu buna kyenina kimvwama kyandi, muna khembu, mwena Kidisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Khembu yakala kwena Nzambi yi Tata wetu, mvula yi mvula! Abwabuna<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboti za tsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Hanenu mboti kwena bakwikidi boosu mwena Kidisitu Yesu. Baphangi babana benina ha kimosi yi meni, mboti baluhekini. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Bakwikidi boosu, mboti baluhekini; theti-theti basadi bana benina mu nganda ya Khayisala. <verse eid="PHP 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Yambula khenda za Pfumu Yesu Kidisitu zakala muna kitembu kyenu!<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
